<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HAB" style="id">HAB- Ngulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Habakuki</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitabu cha Habakuki</para>
  <para style="toc2">Habakuki</para>
  <para style="toc3">Habakuki</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kitabu cha Habakuki</para>
  <para style="mt1">Habak</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongoelo</para>
  <para style="ipi">Kitabu iki kina ulotezi wa Habakuki. kitabu cha Habakuki ni kitabu ki hengi mwa vitabu va ulotezi, kwaviya hakina ulosi uhingile kwa Izilaeli hegu Yuda. Vituhu vakwe kina malongelezo maidi na malombezo ya Habakuki. Mnungu nae ahitula malongelezo yakwe. Wamanyi wafanyanya kugamba Habakuki ekalaga mwo lupisi lumwenga na Yelemia na mwo ulongozi wa seuta Yosia na seuta Yohakimu. Hiyo kitabu cha Habakuki hegu kitabu kituhu chochose che bibilia kilongile mwo lupisi lwa Habakuki ivo ekale.</para>
  <para style="ip">2 Habakuki amlabilaga Mnungu kugamba aonaga nk'humbizi na uwihi, mna hahitule malombezo ya Habakuki ya kulombeza wambizi. Yadahika Habakuki aonaga mbuli izi zikadamanyika mwe isi ya Yuda. Mnungu ahitulaga kwa kugamba andaga akawenula Wababeli wawabanange want'hu wa Yuda. Niyo Habakuki alabila kwa Mnungu nakanda akawatendela want'hu waihi kuwasulumiza wadya wandile hiyo waihi. Mnungu ahitulaga kwa kugamba hata awo Wababeli nawasengelwe. Niyo Habakuki amlombeza Mnungu adamanye na kulagisa uwedi. Amtunya Mnungu kwa mbuli zose nk'hulu zidamanyike aho nk'hongo. Yemndani mwe kitabu cha Habakuki 1. Kulabila kwa nk'hongo kwa Habakuki. 2. Chasoma uhituzi wa nk'hongo wa Mnungu. Mwo msafa 1:5-1. 3. yalonga mwo kulabila kwa kaidi kwa Habakuki. Msafa wa 1:12-2: 4. Uhituzi wa kaidi wa Mnungu. Msafa wa 2: 2-20. 5. Yalagisa malombezo ya Habakuki kwa Mnungu. Msafa wa 3</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HAB 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAB 1:1" />Uno nuwo ulosi Zumbe Mnungu amgubuile mlotezi Habakuki.<verse eid="HAB 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulabila kwa Habakuki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAB 1:2" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu, nohwiile weye unambize mpaka ini? na weye ukaleka kuniiva na kunambiza, Togola nakuwiila kwa mbuli ihile ukaleka kuniyokola? <verse eid="HAB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAB 1:3" />Nii wanitenda niyaombokele maihi na makunt'ho? Ubanangi na masulumizo yanizunguluka miye, kutowana na mahigano yatendesa. <verse eid="HAB 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAB 1:4" />Kwaivo umwiko haukudamanywa ivo ukuungwa kudamanywa hegu uwagilwa haukudamanywa. Waihi wawahuma wawagilwa, ivo hawakusengela kwa uwagilwa.<verse eid="HAB 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uhituzi wa Zumbe Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAB 1:5" />Zumbe Mnungu niyo awagamba, Kauleni want'hu we ziisi zint'huhu mkaule, nanywe nomwituke na kwehelwa. Kwaviya nenidamanye kint'hu mwe mazuwa yenyu mkwikala, nanywe hata mnagambilwa homhuwile. <verse eid="HAB 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAB 1:6" />Nenidisigile fyo dya watowani dya Wakalidayo diwakump'hukile, watowani awo wana nk'hani na wamunk'hiswa naho wazunguluka mwe isi yose na kuwahoka kaya zenyu. <verse eid="HAB 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAB 1:7" />Awo ni want'hu wa kutisa na wakogohwa, wakesaguila wenye cho kudamanya na hawakuzumila umwiko.<verse eid="HAB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAB 1:8" />Falasi wawe wahufu kuguluka kujink'ha suwi, naho watendesa ukali kujink'ha uzi wata sala. Wakugendeza falasi walawa hale, wapilika enga mp'hungu enga ivo ikupola.<verse eid="HAB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAB 1:9" />“Watowani wose naweza kwajili ya kuwabananga want'hu watuhu, futa zawe zatisa, womboka kulongole enga mp'heho ya kwe dijangwa, na kuduganya watahigwa enga msanga wa kwe bahali. <verse eid="HAB 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAB 1:10" />Wawabela maseuta na kuwasogola vilongozi. Waiseka imizi yose izungulusilwe magomela, wakaduganya viumbiko va ulongo na kukwela kuitaha mizi yawe. <verse eid="HAB 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAB 1:11" />Ivo wombokesa enga mp'heho, wadamanya masa kwaviya mnungu ywawe awenk'ha ludole.”<verse eid="HAB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Habakuki amlabila naho Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAB 1:12" />Togola hiyo weye Zumbe Mnungu kulawa aho nk'hongo, weye ni weye Mnungu ywangu nawe ni mkuki naho hukubanika. Weye Zumbe Mnungu kuwasagula Wakalidayo wakisengele, Weye wili luwe lwangu kuwasagula vileke wakisengele suwe. <verse eid="HAB 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAB 1:13" />Weye kukuka hukudaha kukaula yaihile, Nii haluse wakaula wakudamanya yaihile na kunyamala?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 1:13">Nii wanyamala kuona umwo want'hu waihi wakawabinda want'hu wedi kujink'ha woho?<verse eid="HAB 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAB 1:14" />Kuwatenda want'hu enga samaki za mwe bahali, na enga viumbwa vikutambala heviina kilongozi. <verse eid="HAB 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAB 1:15" />Wakalidayo walowa want'hu kwa nduano, enga samaki na kuwaduganya mwe dizuwa dyakwe no kunda na kinyemi! <verse eid="HAB 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAB 1:16" />Ivo wazitambikilaga zinyavu zawe na kufunk'hiza ubani kwaviya zinyavu zawetenda wekale vedi naho zawegaila nk'hande yedi.<verse eid="HAB 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAB 1:17" />Togola want'hu awa hawagendele kutowana nk'hondo, na kuwabananga want'hu wa si nt'huhu haheina mbazi?<verse eid="HAB 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HAB 2" />
  <para style="s">Mnungu amhitula Habakuki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAB 2:1" />Miye nenikimale mwe kaheha kwo luzo, nikaule idyo naanigambile naho ni uhituzi wani nenihitule mwe mbuli ino, uhituzi wa Zumbe.<verse eid="HAB 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAB 2:2" />Zumbe Mnungu niyo ahitula ivi, “Wandika aya huunga hulagise naho yawandike pwilili mwe vibao vileke kila mnt'hu akomboka aho ayasome. <verse eid="HAB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAB 2:3" />Yadya hulagise uyaandike yagojele mwo lupisi noluzumilwe, nayo yasunguza kwiza mwe mazuwa yo uheelo, uneva yanasunguza kwiza. weye ugojele du kindedi hayasunguze kwiza. <verse eid="HAB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAB 2:4" />Wakaule wana kitugu naho awo nawabanike, mna awedi nawekale kwa kumhuwila Mnungu.”<verse eid="HAB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Want'hu wakudamanya maihi nawabanangwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAB 2:5" />Kindedi divai yazaganya, mnt'hu mta weduvi heekalise, kakeika lumwe kuwegala watuhu kwo kubanika, naho hekwiguta na kukeduganyila want'hu we si zose naho awetenda want'hu wose kunda wakwe. <verse eid="HAB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAB 2:6" />Kila mnt'hu naambele mnt'hu enga uyo na kumtuwila wila wa kumsezenga, “Hangi weye mwenye ukukeduganyila vint'hu hi vako na kuguhila want'hu vint'hu vawe haheina kuvuza, nougendeele kudamanya ivo mpaka ini?”<verse eid="HAB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAB 2:7" />Mna zuwa dimwenga wakuunga uwalihe nawasunguze kwiza, Togola wadya wakukutigiza naweze? Togola hawenuke na kukutisa? Aho nawakugwile na kukutenda mtahigwa ywawe. <verse eid="HAB 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAB 2:8" />Kwaviya kutaha ugoli wa want'hu wa si nyingi, mna nawasigale nawakutahe weye, kwaviya kwitila sakame ya mnt'hu na kuibanaga isi na mizi, na kila yumwenga mndani mwakwe.<verse eid="HAB 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAB 2:9" />Hangi weye mwenye ukuzenga nyumba nk'hulu mnanga mwo mnima kwa kuwahujila want'hu, nyumba iyo ukafanyanya kugamba nowinde hale na makunt'ho! <verse eid="HAB 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAB 2:10" />Mna kwa mizungu yako yo ubanangi kusulumiza want'hu wengi, kwa kubananga si nyingi, naho weye mwenye noukomigwe. <verse eid="HAB 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAB 2:11" />Nivo vikuleka hata maiwe nayalabile mwo lukandula, na mp'hapi ze nyumba nazo nezitende iivo.<verse eid="HAB 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAB 2:12" />Hangi weye mwenye ukuzenga mzi kwa kuwakoma want'hu na kuukimalisa mzi mkulu kwa uwihi. <verse eid="HAB 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAB 2:13" />Togola Zumbe Mnungu mta udahi niye akukint'hiza kukombekesa kwa want'hu kwagile mwo moto na want'hu we si zidamanye ndima heeina kint'hu? <verse eid="HAB 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAB 2:14" />Kwaviya want'hu nawameme mwe isi kwa kuumanya ung'azi wa Mnungu enga viya mazi yakugenyeela mwe bahali.<verse eid="HAB 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAB 2:15" />Hangi weye mwenye ukuwenk'ha wambwizo mp'hombe vileke iwatende wakolwe kwa kuwagidila mp'hombe mwe kazae vileke uwone ivo wekale kimbwigili. <verse eid="HAB 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAB 2:16" />Noune soni na want'hu hawakutunye. Nowiinywe we mwenye na kuzembeduka. Zumbe Mnungu mweye naakutende ukolwe na soni nezinde mwako. <verse eid="HAB 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAB 2:17" />Maihi ayo uwadamanyile want'hu wa Lebanoni noukuuwiye weye mwenye, na ubanangi uidamanyile mifugwa noukutise, naivo uwakoma want'hu wakwikala mwe mizi ino na kila yumwenga mndani mwakwe.<verse eid="HAB 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HAB 2:18" />Mahili yasongolwe ni mnt'hu yana ndima yani? Ni hili dilungumlwe du dikuhiniza udant'hi, kwaviya wadya wadamanye dihili wadihuwila dihili hedikulonga! <verse eid="HAB 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HAB 2:19" />Hangi weye mwenye uyo naaugambe “mti inuka!” Hegu “iwe kimala!” Togola hili dyadaha kuhiniza mnt'hu? Kaula ihakigwa zahabu na masawa, mna haina ugima wowose.<verse eid="HAB 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HAB 2:20" />Mna Zumbe Mnungu eyumo mwe nyumba yakwe ikukile, want'hu we si zose wanyamale kwakwe.<verse eid="HAB 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HAB 3" />
  <para style="s">Mlotezi Habakuki alombeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAB 3:1" />Mlotezi Habakuki alombeza ivi,<verse eid="HAB 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAB 3:2" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu hiva mbuli zako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:2">na miye nogoha yadya udamanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:2">uyadamanye naho mwo lupisi lwetu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:2">yatende yamanyike mwe miyaka yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:2">ukanda na maya chakulombeza ukionele mbazi.<verse eid="HAB 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAB 3:3" />Mnungu keza kulawa Temani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:3">Mnungu akukile keza kulawa mwo mnima Palani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:3">Ung'azi wakwe ugenyela kwe mbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:3">na want'hu wose wa mwe si wamtogola yehe.<verse eid="HAB 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAB 3:4" />Ung'azi wakwe ni enga zuwa dikulawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:4">miali yakwe yamulikaga kulawa mwo mkono wakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:4">umwo ludole lwakwe nolufiswa.<verse eid="HAB 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAB 3:5" />Ayegala manyonge yaihile kulongole kwakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:5">kunyuma kwakwe atimilwa ni ubanangi.<verse eid="HAB 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAB 3:6" />Anakimala si yasingisika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:6">akasinya want'hu wa mwe si wazingiza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:6">Milima ya kale yatulika tulika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:6">Vinenengwa va kale vagwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:6">sila zakwe zekala ni za ulo na ulo.<verse eid="HAB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAB 3:7" />Nawaonaga want'hu wa Kushani wakasulumila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:7">na want'hu wa Midiani wakazingiza.<verse eid="HAB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAB 3:8" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu, togola kuihia imito?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:8">Togola kuihia vizuto?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:8">Togola kuihia mazi ya mwe bahali</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:8">Hata kugendeza falasi zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:8">na magali yakugendezwa na falasi kupata uhumi.<verse eid="HAB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAB 3:9" />Kuiika lumwe uta wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:9">niyo wagela misale yako mwe sigi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:9">Na kuitenda mito itule isi.<verse eid="HAB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAB 3:10" />Milima neikuona niyo yazingiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:10">malawo niyo yomboka uumwo yetika kulawa kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:10">mina ye bahali niyo yant'hint'hila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:10">na mjubwaniso wakwe niyo weza kulanga.<verse eid="HAB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAB 3:11" />Zuwa no mnenge nevinyamalisa mwo ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:11">kwa ung'azi wa misale yako ikulasigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:11">ung'azi wo mjungo wako ukametameta.<verse eid="HAB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAB 3:12" />Kwa maya yako wombokaga mnanga mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:12">na kwa maya yako kuwajata want'hu wa si zose.<verse eid="HAB 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAB 3:13" />Nokwiza kuwayokola want'hu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:13">kumyokola yudya umsagule kwa kumkumba mavuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:13">Umhondile kilongozi we difyo dya waihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:13">na kuwabananga pele fyo dyakwe.<verse eid="HAB 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAB 3:14" />Kwa mjungo wako mwenye wawatulaga mitwi yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:14">watowani wakwe wazaga enga kasungula vileke kisambale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:14">wakanda na kinyemi enga we hagihi na kukifunj'ha, wadya wasokezi wandile mwe kukefisa.<verse eid="HAB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAB 3:15" />Wombokaga mwe bahali kwa falasi zako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:15">bahali ikuzungulukwa ni mjubwaniso.<verse eid="HAB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAB 3:16" />Nevaga mwo moyo wangu niyo nogoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:16">milomo yangu niyo yazingiza ize ive izwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:16">usokezi niyo wanyatila mwe mavuha yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:16">na viga vangu havikudaha kugenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:16">Hata ivo nenigojele mwe dizuwa idyo dyo ubanangi dikuwezila wadya wakukukimp'hukila.<verse eid="HAB 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAB 3:17" />Ikanda mtini hakusuka mabwali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:17">naho hahana zabibu mwo mzabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:17">ikanda mzeituni haukweleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:17">naho hata migunda haikulava nk'hande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:17">ikanda hahana ngoto mwe didewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:17">hegu ng'ombe mwe didewa,<verse eid="HAB 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HAB 3:18" />Miye nenigendee kunda na kinyemi mwa Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:18">nenewange kwa Zumbe Mnungu myokozi wangu.<verse eid="HAB 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HAB 3:19" />Zumbe Mnungu niye ludole lwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:19">aitogeza viga vangu kunda na ludole enga mbala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:19">aitenda idahe kombokela mwe milima.<verse eid="HAB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAB 3" />
</usx>